  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AA 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}汪！汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 02}哟！\n你也吃点什么吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}毕竟人是铁，饭是钢嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}人是铁……？\n这是什么意思？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}联谊的时候肚子咕咕叫，\n会影响形象吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9B 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}每次邂逅都是一生一次的大决战。\n所以得先吃饱！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 87 0B}先吃饱……原来如此。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}你又在瞎扯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}汪呜。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……话说回来，\n为什么会是“联谊咖啡厅”呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真会往伤口上撒盐啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3E 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}关于学长们举办的\n联谊咖啡厅，\n我不是很了解……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 84 08}文化祭开联谊咖啡厅，真厉害啊。\n该怎么说呢，很前卫？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 06}倒不如说是退化了吧。\n真想看看提议的人长什么样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CC 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}是、是啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 0D}这所学校和你们的八十神高中\n很像，对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}岂止是像，\n几乎一模一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}只是房间数量更多，\n活动内容似乎也与实际不同。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}文化祭搞“联谊咖啡厅”这种事，\n总不至于每个学校都有吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}是……真是惭愧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我是说，这恐怕不是巧合。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:19:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这里像你们的八十神高中，\n有你们提议的联谊咖啡厅，\n内容却又不一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 42 06}也就是说……这是怎么回事？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不知道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 0C}没必要着急。\n先做眼下能做的事，\n之后再慢慢核对答案就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不然，说不定会漏掉什么。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AC 0C}汪。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5A 06}嗯……说得对。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_021.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0C 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}糟了……好帅啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
